  DisplayName: A Passion for the Oriental Room
  EventType: 1
  Description: The smoking room hung with carpets and cushions {has become|is becoming}
    the fashion in every good house. Ottoman rugs and embroideries {are sold|will
    sell} as fast as the dealers can unroll them, and the merchants of Constantinople
    {are raising|will raise} their prices.
